**/data/syzygy/
# Polyglot opening books and any backup-of-prior-book copies
**/data/book.bin
**/data/book.*.bak
**/data/book.*.bin
# Generic backup pattern (belt-and-suspenders)
*.bak
# Cross-game MCTS transposition cache (grows)
**/data/mcts_cache.json
**/data/mcts_cache.json.tmp
# Syzygy table files (belt-and-suspenders in case syzygy/ moves)
*.rtbw
*.rtbz

